- Avg lifetime (periods) ≈ 1 / churn_rate (if churn expressed per period)
- LTV (simple, period basis) = ARPU(period) × gross_margin × avg_lifetime(periods)
  - Example for monthly: LTV_monthly = ARPU_monthly * gross_margin * (1 / monthly_churn)
- LTV:CAC ratio = LTV / CAC — benchmark target usually ~3:1 (≥3 good), <1 bad

