I can help in two ways — manage emails or work on the finance/CAC-LTV stuff for Horizon Media. Which would you like me to do first?

If you want finance help, I can:
- Calculate CAC and LTV if you give me inputs (marketing & sales spend, new customers acquired, ARPU or avg revenue per customer, churn or avg customer lifetime, gross margin).
- Build the finance narrative and slides/text for your internal materials.
- Draft the request email to marketing/sales to collect the needed inputs (and send or save it as a draft for you).

If you want email help, tell me exactly what to do:
- Read/summarize your inbox
- Search for a specific email (give a descriptive query)
- Reply or forward an email (tell me the search query and the reply/forward text/recipient)
- Draft a new message

Quick templates and notes to speed things up

1) Request email to marketing/sales for CAC/LTV inputs
Subject: Request — CAC & LTV inputs for finance materials
Body:
Hi [Name],
I’m preparing our internal finance materials for next month. Please send the following for the last 12 months (or most recent period):
- Total marketing + sales spend (broken down by channel if possible)
- Number of new customers acquired (by month if available)
- Average revenue per customer (monthly or annual), and any ARPA/ARPU by segment
- Customer churn rate or average customer lifespan
- Gross margin % assumptions
If you can share channel-level CAC and any cohort data, that would be very helpful. Please send this by [deadline].
Thanks — [Your name]

I can draft and send that for you — tell me the recipient(s) and deadline.

2) Quick CAC & LTV formulas
- CAC = (Total marketing + sales spend) / (Number of new customers acquired)
- LTV (simple) = ARPU per period * (1 / churn rate) * gross margin
  - Example: monthly ARPU $100, monthly churn 5% → avg lifetime = 1/0.05 = 20 months → gross-margin-adjusted LTV = 100 * 20 * gross_margin

If you want, give me the numbers you have and I’ll compute CAC and LTV and draft the finance narrative.

Which do you want me to do now?

